# vergeio_network_wireguard_peer (Resource)

`vergeio_network_wireguard_peer` is one peer on a [`vergeio_network_wireguard`](network_wireguard.md) interface. Set `wireguard_id` to that interface's id so Terraform destroys the peer first.

`configure_firewall` defaults to `site-to-site`, which stages firewall rules. `apply` defaults to true and refreshes the interface's network after a change, including Accept WireGuard rules the interface leaves staged. A stopped network is not refreshed.

